The first step is to check if the end of the table has already been reached. In that case,
an application of ++ will have no e ff ect. Otherwise, the location of the iterator is advanced
inside its current bucket. A check is made to see if the one past the end node of the current
list object has been reached. In that event, the next nonempty bucket or pCH->end() is
found via nextBucket.
